<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady/$0.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady/$0.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.25 higher. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    58.00-58.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    54.00-55.50</p>
<p>Compared with Friday sows 300-450 lbs 0.25 higher; 450-500 lbs steady to 0.50 lower; 500-650 lbs uneven steady with Fridays average. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs     46.25</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs     47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs     49.00-51.00, few 48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
